ndustry partners.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj49 0 obj<</E(To successfully complete this program and receive the prestigious Certificate of Completion and professional certification on AI & Data Science from DICHI Academy, you must fulfill the following requirements:)/K[30]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/H4/T(To successfully complete this program and receive the prestigious Certificate of Completion and professional certification on AI & Data Science from DICHI Academy, you must fulfill the following requirements:)/Type/StructElem>>endobj50 0 obj<</E(Attend all the required content and practice sessions organized by the program team \(unless you have a valid reason for absence, i.e. unexpected health issues or family emergencies\); )/K[31]/P 128 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/H4/T(Attend all the required content and practice sessions organized by the program team \(unless you have a valid reason for absence, i.e. unexpected health issues or family emergencies\); )/Type/StructElem>>endobj51 0 obj<</E(Actively engage and participate in the sessions and workshops; and)/K[32]/P 129 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/H4/T(Actively engage and participate in the sessions and workshops; and)/Type/StructElem>>endobj52 0 obj<</E(Approach every session with an open mind, a respectful demeanor, and be supportive of one another.)/K[33]/P 130 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/H4/T(Approach every session with an open mind, a respectful demeanor, and be supportive of one another.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj53 0 obj<</E(We are thrilled to welcome you to the 2026 Cohort of the Techpreneur Bootcamp and witness your transformation into a well-rounded, employment-ready professional in full-stack development, and AI & Data Science. Please indicate your acceptance or rejection\ of this offer by ticking the appropriate box below, along with your signature, and return it to the DICHI Academy team by 08 June 2026.)/K[34]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/H4/T(We are thrilled to welcome you to the 2026 Cohort of the Techpreneur Bootcamp and witness your transformation into a well-rounded, employment-ready professional in full-stack development, and AI & Data Science. Please indicate your acceptance or rejection\ of this offer by ticking the appropriate box below, along with your signature, and return it to the DICHI Academy team by 08 June 2026.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj54 0 obj<</E(Dear)/K[35]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/H4/T(Dear)/Type/StructElem>>endobj55 0 obj<</E(Implemented By)/K[36]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj56 0 obj<</E(Supported By)/K[37]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj57 0 obj<</E(Doeun Bunheng,)/K[38]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/H4/T(Doeun Bunheng,)/Type/StructElem>>endobj58 0 obj<</A[131 0 R 0]/K[39]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj59 0 obj<</A[132 0 R 0]/K[40]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj60 0 obj<</A[133 0 R 0]/K[41]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj61 0 obj<</A[134 0 R 0]/K[42]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj62 0 obj<</A[135 0 R 0]/K[43]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj63 0 obj<</A[136 0 R 0]/K[44]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj64 0 obj<</A[137 0 R 0]/K[45]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj65 0 obj<</A[138 0 R 0]/K[46]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj66 0 obj<</A[139 0 R 0]/K[47]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj67 0 obj<</A[140 0 R 0]/K[48]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj68 0 obj<</A[141 0 R 0]/K[49]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj69 0 obj<</A[142 0 R 0]/K[50]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj70 0 obj<</A[143 0 R 0]/K[51]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj71 0 obj<</A[144 0 R 0]/K[52]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj72 0 obj<</A[145 0 R 0]/K[53]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj73 0 obj<</A[146 0 R 0]/K[54]/P 18 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj74 0 ob