uang Lay                                      Chief Executive Officer                    Managing Director The Expert Leadership                      DICHI Academy Innovation Exchange)>>endobj254 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 243 0 R/Parent 14 0 R/Prev 266 0 R/Title(Yours sincerely,)>>endobj266 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 254 0 R/Parent 14 0 R/Prev 278 0 R/Title(We are thrilled to welcome you to the 2026 Cohort of the Techpreneur Bootcamp and witness your transformation into a well-rounded, employment-ready professional in full-stack development, and AI & Data Science. Please indicate your acceptance or rejection\ of this offer by ticking the appropriate box below, along with your signature, and return it to the DICHI Academy team by 08 June 2026.)>>endobj278 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 266 0 R/Parent 14 0 R/Prev 284 0 R/Title(Approach every session with an open mind, a respectful demeanor, and be supportive of one another.)>>endobj284 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 278 0 R/Parent 14 0 R/Prev 277 0 R/Title(Actively engage and participate in the sessions and workshops; and)>>endobj277 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 284 0 R/Parent 14 0 R/Prev 265 0 R/Title(Attend all the required content and practice sessions organized by the program team \(unless you have a valid reason for absence, i.e. unexpected health issues or family emergencies\);)>>endobj265 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 277 0 R/Parent 14 0 R/Prev 253 0 R/Title(To successfully complete this program and receive the prestigious Certificate of Completion and professional certification on AI & Data Science from DICHI Academy, you must fulfill the following requirements:)>>endobj253 0 obj<</Count -7/Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/First 263 0 R/Last 264 0 R/Next 265 0 R/Parent 14 0 R/Prev 242 0 R/Title(program timeline \(7 Months\))>>endobj263 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 273 0 R/Parent 253 0 R/Title(4 Months)>>endobj264 0 obj<</Count -3/Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/First 275 0 R/Last 276 0 R/Parent 253 0 R/Prev 274 0 R/Title(MVP DEMO DAY)>>endobj242 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 253 0 R/Parent 14 0 R/Prev 150 0 R/Title(The Techpreneur Bootcamp is an intensive, hands-on learning, 7-month long program, supporting students in mastering full-stack development, and AI & Data Science alongside business acumen. The training sessions will take place virtually on Wednesdays from\ 8pm-10pm and in-person on Saturdays from 8am-12pm \(extending to full day on some occasions\) commencing from early July 2026 to February 2027. Not only does this program provide students with a well rounded set of skills; but it also provides opportunit\ies for participants to connect with employers and access exclusive job opportunities from our industry partners.)>>endobj150 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 242 0 R/Parent 14 0 R/Prev 77 0 R/Title(We are thrilled to extend an exclusive invitation for you to join the prestigious Techpreneur Bootcamp co-organized and co-funded by DICHI Academy and The Expert Leadership Innovation Exchange \(ELIX\).)>>endobj275 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 283 0 R/Parent 264 0 R/Title(Late June, 2026)>>endobj276 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Parent 264 0 R/Prev 283 0 R/Title(July - Oct 2026)>>endobj274 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 264 0 R/Parent 253 0 R/Prev 282 0 R/Title(ACCELERATED LEARNING)>>endobj282 0 obj<</Count -1/Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/First 286 0 R/Last 286 0 R/Next 274 0 R/Parent 253 0 R/Prev 285 0 R/Title(HACKATHON/MVP DEVELOPMENT)>>endobj286 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Parent 282 0 R/Title(Dec 2026 - Feb 2027)>>endobj285 0 obj<</Count -1/Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/First 287 0 R/Last 287 0 R/Next 282 0 R/Parent 253 0 R/Prev 281 0 R/Title(WORKSHOPS & IDEATION CHALLENGES)>>endobj287 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Parent 285 0 R/Title(Nov 2026)>>endobj281 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 285 0 R/Parent 253 0 R/Prev 273 0 R/Title(PROGRAM LAUNCH DAY)>>endobj273 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 281 0 R/Parent 253 0 R/Prev 263 0 R/Title(3 Months)>>endobj283 0 obj<</Dest[9 0 R/Fit]/Next 